-- Status: UNVERIFIED
MODULE [adv_weakened]
THEOREM [adv_weakened]:
  GIVEN:
    - [hx]: $x$ is a real number
  CLAIM:
    $x^2 \geq 0$ or $x$ is a real number
PROOF OF [adv_weakened]:
  [1] HAVE $x$ is a real number.
      BY [hx].
  [2] SHOW $x^2 \geq 0$ or $x$ is a real number.
      BY [1], disjunction introduction.
  QED BY [2].
